# WebRTC TURN (required for calls across countries / carrier NAT, e.g. VN ↔ JP)
# 1) Create a free Metered account: https://www.metered.ca/tools/openrelay/
# 2) Open your app dashboard → copy the TURN credentials API URL (includes apiKey)
# 3) Paste it here, then rebuild:
# VITE_METERED_TURN_CREDENTIALS_URL=https://YOUR_APP.metered.live/api/v1/turn/credentials?apiKey=YOUR_KEY
#
# Or use a private TURN:
# VITE_WEBRTC_TURN_URL=turn:turn.example.com:3478,turns:turn.example.com:443
# VITE_WEBRTC_TURN_USERNAME=...
# VITE_WEBRTC_TURN_CREDENTIAL=...
